    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"small breaks\" don't really work though. i try to be different, i try to stay sober or keep my temper in check, but i can feel the darkness just sitting there, waiting. it's like every time i take a step forward, the family history just pulls me back. it feels less like a struggle and more like a script i'm just following. eventually, the pattern always wins.",
